%% UML Sequence Diagram - Order Placement and PayNow Payment
sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant Web as Mobile Front-End
    participant API as API Backend
    participant DB as Relational DB
    participant PayNow as PayNow Gateway
    participant KDS as KDS Tablet

    Customer->>Web: Select items and customization
    Web->>API: POST /api/v1/orders
    API->>DB: Create order (pending payment)
    DB-->>API: Order ID and total
    API-->>Web: Payment required
    Web->>PayNow: Initiate PayNow payment
    PayNow-->>Customer: Payment authorization
    Customer->>PayNow: Confirm payment
    PayNow-->>API: Payment confirmation
    API->>DB: Record payment as PAID
    API->>DB: Update order as paid/releasable
    API->>KDS: Release paid order
    KDS-->>API: Order received as Pending
    API-->>Web: Order/payment confirmation
